            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MAMALEIGH"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A very good drink, but maybe a little too sweet for some. I like this best with ginger ale, and sometimes with a little OJ, as well. If you're feeling naughty, add a splash of vodka or gin. Enjoy!",
            "datePublished": "2009-11-01T18:47:32.030Z"
          },
