            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ColoradoCook"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Been drinking these for over 50 years. Wonder if it is regional thing if it is made with gingerale or lemon lime soda. I thought restaurants only made it with lemon lime soda if they did not have gingerale on hand, but apparently not. Introduced my 77 year old mother-in-law to them this summer and she wants them whenever she is at our house now. Husband and kids love them too.",
