            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Erin"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great recipe - simple and tastes exactly how I remember it, brings back good memories! I like it with the lemon-lime soda, but ginger ale is my favorite!",
            "datePublished": "2013-01-25T17:38:30.293Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
